WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.757
Results are striking for a label-free method.

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:07.593
On MVTec AD,

00:00:07.673 --> 00:00:11.430
MuSc reaches ninety-seven point eight percent image
AUROC and lifts per-region overlap

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:15.267
segmentation by over twenty-one points versus the
best prior zero-shot method.

00:00:15.347 --> 00:00:19.103
On VisA it gains over ten points.

00:00:19.183 --> 00:00:22.940
It even beats most four-shot methods and rivals
full-shot approaches.
